---
import { LINKS } from '../../config/links';
---

<section class="diagnostic-hero">
  <div class="hero-bg"></div>

  <div class="container hero-grid">
    <div class="copy reveal">
      <span class="badge">Diagnóstico Operativo Inteligente</span>

      <h1>Descubre qué está frenando la eficiencia de tu negocio.</h1>

      <p>
        Analizamos cómo funciona tu operación y te entregamos un plan claro para
        simplificar procesos, eliminar tareas innecesarias y automatizar solo
        aquello que realmente genera valor.
      </p>

      <div class="actions">
        <a href={LINKS.calendly.diagnostic} class="btn-primary">
          Solicitar diagnóstico
        </a>

        <a href="#informe" class="btn-secondary">
          Ver qué incluye
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="price-note">
        <strong>Revisión inicial sin costo</strong>
        <span>Identificamos el principal cuello de botella antes de recomendar una solución.</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="report-card reveal">
      <div class="report-header">
        <small>Informe Operativo Inteligente</small>
        <strong>Vista previa</strong>
      </div>

      <div class="report-list">
        <div>
          <span></span>
          <p>Mapa del flujo de trabajo</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <span></span>
          <p>Cuello de botella principal</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <span></span>
          <p>Tareas repetitivas detectadas</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <span></span>
          <p>Oportunidades de mejora</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <span></span>
          <p>Plan de implementación por prioridades</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .diagnostic-hero {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: 96px 0 120px;
    background: #ffffff;
  }

  .hero-bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 78% 20%, rgba(37,99,235,.15), transparent 28%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 90% 64%, rgba(6,182,212,.13), transparent 24%),
      linear-gradient(rgba(15,23,42,.035) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(15,23,42,.035) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: auto, auto, 48px 48px, 48px 48px;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .hero-grid {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    display: grid;
    gap: 72px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .copy {
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    border: 1px solid #bfdbfe;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: #eff6ff;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    color: #2563eb;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 26px 0 0;
    color: #0f172a;
    font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 6vw, 4.7rem);
    line-height: .98;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: -.07em;
  }

  p {
    max-width: 650px;
    margin: 28px 0 0;
    color: #475569;
    font-size: 19px;
    line-height: 1.85;
  }

  .actions {
    margin-top: 38px;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .price-note {
    margin-top: 30px;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: center;
    color: #64748b;
  }

  .price-note strong {
    color: #2563eb;
    font-size: 24px;
  }

  .report-card {
    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    border-radius: 30px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(37,99,235,.12), transparent 34%),
      #ffffff;
    padding: 30px;
    box-shadow: 0 30px 80px rgba(15,23,42,.12);
  }

  .report-header {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    padding-bottom: 22px;
  }

  .report-header small {
    display: block;
    color: #2563eb;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: .14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .report-header strong {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 8px;
    color: #0f172a;
    font-size: 28px;
    letter-spacing: -.04em;
  }

  .report-list {
    display: grid;
    gap: 14px;
    margin-top: 24px;
  }

  .report-list div {
    display: flex;
    gap: 14px;
    align-items: center;
    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    border-radius: 16px;
    background: white;
    padding: 16px;
  }

  .report-list span {
    width: 12px;
    height: 12px;
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563eb, #06b6d4);
  }

  .report-list p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #0f172a;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .hero-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1.05fr .95fr;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .diagnostic-hero {
      padding: 70px 0 90px;
    }

    .actions a {
      width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>